WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.800
Donald Trump's still not accepting

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.880
the results of the presidential election,

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:09.061
but we have a sponsor
who may be able to help.

00:00:09.061 --> 00:00:09.894
(Conan singing nonsense)

00:00:09.894 --> 00:00:11.830
(intense music)

00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:13.900
Hi, I'm Shaquille O'Neal.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:15.040
Don't believe me?

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:16.890
Then I'll see you in court.

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:20.260
And I'm Meryl Streep, and
I'm also wearing a suit.

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:23.170
Don't believe me, then I'll
see you in court, as well.

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:25.400
Is reality not what you want it to be?

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.350
Did you lose a presidential election

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:29.910
and aren't able to accept that reality?

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:31.270
Then hire us.

00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:33.860
The law firm of O'Neal and Streep.

00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:35.250
And we will help you

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:37.370
[Together] Sue reality.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:40.860
If you want to challenge the
fabric of reality itself,

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:45.300
you need Shaquille O'Neal and
Maryl Streep in your corner.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:47.500
And that's who we say we are.

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:49.080
My socks and my shoes are large

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:50.590
because I'm Shaquille O'Neal.

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:52.930
I'll take on your case
with the same determination

00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:55.653
that won me four NBA Championships.

00:00:57.910 --> 00:00:59.410
And I'll give you the same passion

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:02.760
that won me the number
of Oscars that I have.

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:05.900
Most of the women I date
are very much tinier than me

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:09.100
'cause I'm large.

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:11.620
We've helped thousands of clients.

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:14.570
Reality said our client wasn't famous.

00:01:14.570 --> 00:01:17.200
We took reality to court and won.

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:19.620
Reality said our client
wasn't a good singer.

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:23.670
We took reality to court and won.

00:01:23.670 --> 00:01:26.120
Reality said our client wasn't Black.

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:29.010
We took reality to court and won.

00:01:29.010 --> 00:01:30.679
Reality said our client wasn't handsome

00:01:30.679 --> 00:01:32.386
and alluring to women.

00:01:32.386 --> 00:01:34.723
We took reality to court.

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:41.250
Why did we put that one in the ad?

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:42.083
We lost.

00:01:42.083 --> 00:01:43.130
Don't trust us?

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:46.680
Take it from this person who knows us.

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:47.930
[Deep Voice] You fools.

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:50.730
Reality says that President Trump

00:01:50.730 --> 00:01:53.000
didn't win the 2020 election.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:54.573
You know who to call, Donald.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:58.410
Call the law firm of O'Neal and Streep.

00:01:58.410 --> 00:02:03.280
Dial 555-555-5-5555.

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:05.180
[Narrator] With offices
located in New York,

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:08.357
Paris, Rio, Mars, Prague, and Wakanda.

